        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are the Whatever Club!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The super-popular singing group “Melon Parker” is now in a visual novel game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the youthful story you’ll experience together with MELON PARKER -We are Whatever Club!-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>🍈Synopsis🍈</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are the Whatever Club!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your five childhood friends,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naroya, Samurai Sho, Soraneko, KAITO, and Kamome,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are members of the private Melonpan High School’s “Whatever Club”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While cheerfully solving the incidents that happen at school and enjoying your high school life,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you suddenly get the chance to perform at a music festival!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the “Whatever Club” succeed at</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the big stage of the music festival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And where will your youthful story with the five of them lead...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>🍈Characters🍈</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Naroya (cv. Naroya)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reliable member who supports you in the Whatever Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses sharp reasoning skills to solve the mysteries that happen at school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Samurai Sho (cv. Samurai Sho)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Whatever Club’s quick-witted man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes ends up in unfortunate situations because of the other members’ wild ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Soraneko (cv. Soraneko)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easygoing by nature, and sometimes ends up pulling the others along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loves snacks and games, and often invites you to join in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・KAITO (cv. KAITO)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The self-proclaimed dark hero of the Whatever Club with a eighth-grader syndrome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has a kind heart and will always stand by friends and those in trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Kamome (cv. Kamome)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gourmet who, like KAITO, also has eighth-grader syndrome tendencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has a mature way of thinking and so the other members often rely on him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>🍈SPECIAL THANKS🍈</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melon Parker (MEROPRO)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whomor Inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>🍈Recommended for:🍈</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who love internet singers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who want to experience a sparkling youth story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Meloris” who are crazy about Melon Parker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>○Novel Game Brand &quot;Rabbitfoot”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A novel game brand that delivers novel games casting active YouTubers and VTubers as game characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As well as using their names and nicknames, you can enjoy the different sides of your faves and feel a close connection through the novel game that you cannot experience in the usual streaming or video uploads.</p>",
